Fixes baked into the prebuilt lib/coopnet/ios/libcoopnet.a. There is no build rule
for that archive in this repo, so without this patch they are unreproducible.

  1. socket.cpp  SocketGetInfoBits() - iOS returns the sentinel 02:00:00:00:00:00
     for every interface, collapsing the fingerprint to 7919 + 2*ifaceCount. Use a
     persisted per-install random id when every address is masked.
  2. socket.cpp  SocketSetOptions()  - SO_LINGER { 1, 0 } was an abortive close
     (RST, send buffer discarded). Now { 0, 0 }.
  3. connection.cpp Receive()        - the OSX_BUILD guard returned unconditionally,
     so a dropped connection was never detected. Probe with a 1-byte MSG_PEEK.

Base: coop-deluxe/coopnet @ 9d9b3dd4e87dba2fa3ca542ae32b73f43df32b0e
Apply: git -C <coopnet> apply coopnet-ios-fixes.patch

Rebuild (arm64; add -DLOGGING for coopnet's LOG_*, off in the shipped archive):

    SDK=$(xcrun --sdk iphoneos --show-sdk-path)
    for f in common/*.cpp; do
        xcrun --sdk iphoneos clang++ -target arm64-apple-ios15.0 -isysroot "$SDK" \
            -std=c++17 -O2 -fPIC -DOSX_BUILD=1 \
            -Icommon -Ilib/include -c "$f" -o "${f%.cpp}.o"
    done
    xcrun --sdk iphoneos ar rcs libcoopnet.a common/*.o
    xcrun --sdk iphoneos ranlib libcoopnet.a

Build the game with build-ios/ + xcodebuild, never `make` -- the Makefile deletes
lang/, built-in mods and palettes/ at parse time.

